<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces are confronting intensified attacks by guerrilla groups and dissidents, including a drone strike in Choco that killed two soldiers and a bomb near a military base that killed four civilians, among them a two-month-old infant, with Venezuela reported to have helped carry out the drone strike. The government has responded with a broader offensive, deploying 1,200 troops to the Venezuela border, tightening surrender terms, and revoking the “total peace” approach by reclassifying rebels as non-political actors under a new law. The United Nations has renewed its mission in Colombia, excluding rural reform, and 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOYmJTMW1BMXg5NU1mSk1iMVBJNVhyQWx2ZTFZSGhDSnFVaE1Vb1NpdHluRXFCakdTVXhpV1NmeFkzT3hQVi0wazJZV2hUcExFbkd0TEcwSlV6SkNaTXVPS3JkYkRWaDhnY25nRUFZaEIwSjRxOFhST1VnbVM1LU5TNmRISnlRQ1RhZ2NHZnV2S3lhcEpZMjRYNk5GcGlMWDVXRWNXSWxkdDlXR0FVSkI5bDFLVkZmNkQxcnNlWFJRSERLR2R3MVFuYUdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQV2JtLTUxR2RiTmlwNnljTDdjcDVjeHVkYVg0QktsS0tiUVhCOVBWMGNfejJTbG1MNUNOQ2lFZnhla3hGTDJ2eVFXRG14Yjk3am8wM3gyQ3E5b1ZGRzNoalJMQ0I1MXUxbDdUMkRJdmZucFNXWTFFTkZUN3Vpc0FVeWRiYzM0Sno1cS1JNTZrTG1BbmRiQk54Z3RuWllZOF96NjkyZkRoQzdvYWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPb2p4akFMdUxTeWtlSkhaLXZBdXdyWkZLSFlPMm1EbDhGelRsUVlxV0N3cnYwZlZZemZiQWRrdTM0RVhhTG5PbDVVcy0xaVNEVW56d2FEYnA0ZGs2aEpnSFlmV2FuV3NHZ1F3N1pENC1Xa2JGeWJ3emo4eGY3ZkdHODEzcFMyUWYyRU9LQ1NjM1J1d29LaEpDMG9Tdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiw